  "notes": "Both images show the same T-Call V1.3 artwork. Labels taken from the diagram boxes (grey Name box placed first in functions when a GPIO name is printed). TXD/RXD GPIO boxes are printed 'GOIO01'/'GOIO03' (typo) and copied as printed. SD0/SD1 boxes read with digit by index context. The SIM800L table (TX 26, RX 27, PWKEY 4, RST 5, POWER 23) lists internal modem connections, not header pins, and is not transcribed."
